es: she has raised about $2.4 million and holds more cash than Mrvan, and Donald Trump endorsed her in July, with national GOP money flowing into the district. Mrvan has matched her fundraising and drawn outside support while campaigning on labor and local issues. The race remains Mrvan's to lose, though the margin could be closer than ratings suggest.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9569, "margin": 11.29}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9243, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9308, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9246, "margin": 10.6}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9079, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9227, "margin": 9.5}]}